5,1,1,talk,Midori,,We need to ensure we don't repeat past mistakes. I'm interested in why our previous plans failed to stick and who actually takes responsibility when things break.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The depot floor is the real test. I want to see how our actual hardware and peak schedules handled previous attempts at modernization.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I'm worried about technical debt. I want to look into how our systems age and whether external migrations actually hold up over time.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,We can't ignore the people. I want to know about our staffing gaps and how the supervisors actually reacted to the last rollout.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A headline price is a fairy tale. I'll be looking into the actual flow of money and how our renewal costs have behaved.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Ryuji, do you think the yard devices are the biggest bottleneck, or is it the scheduling itself?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Both. The hardware is ancient, and the calendar is unforgiving. I'll check the 2021 trial and the peak-season cutover.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, if the supervisors dropped the training, it suggests the tools weren't intuitive. I'll check the dispatch tool's upgrade history.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,Exactly. I'll look into the administrator retirements and the depot supervisors' behavior during the last rollout.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Midori, accountability often follows the money. I'll examine the board minutes and the renewal invoices to see where the leaks are.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Midori,,I'll take the support ownership during the outage and the warehouse rule changes. That should cover accountability and adaptability.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,pass,Ryuji,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I'll add the 2018 pay move data lift to my list. I suspect the external work was sloppy.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
